{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"平\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\",\n    \"load\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y 的大块保留了完整的处境、原因和转折，单看大字也能串起故事；X 的加亮词虽然抓重点，但因果关系经常需要小字补足。small：Y 的感受按时间点补充身体体验，和话的内容衔接较直接；X 的感受较长，有时在人物体验、音乐分析和情绪解释之间跳转。core：两版都完整保留了不愿再受委屈与怀念旧日亲近、归属之间的反复拉扯，结尾也都落在不强迫自己选边、带着想念继续生活，判平；concise：Y 的叙述更收束，X 的部分感受会重复话里已经表达的不服气、想念和心慌。human：X 更自然，Y 有“胸口那团结还硌着”“耳边一阵阵发空”“下一拍又被提紧”等具体搭配不够自然的问题。fine：Y 更集中于肩背、呼吸、脚步、胸口等观众可以直接感受到的身体体验；X 有不少感受实际上在描述和弦、旋律或音乐结构。load：X 的大字总量明显较少，Y 每屏有多块整段大字，尤其 S08—S12 等较短停留屏，累积阅读量更大。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d20e5029-bdcf-4f0a-924a-b7ca957bffb2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261111T205051269591Z", "elapsed_seconds": 199.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T20:54:11.106552+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c54c6402e1387f3021ef4f1ae8027a11ec0b480bf7aa05d954ce203169a76495", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": 